# NOTE (updated 2026-06-20): public digests under agora_output/ stay TRACKED, but agora_output/lab/ is now
# treated as SCRATCH and ignored. Rationale: the brain's Lab organ writes experiments there continuously and
# they piled up as ~780 uncommitted files (source-control noise). Provenance is preserved without them:
# meaningful labs are embedded in the Crucible ledger (public/crucible/crucible.json 'code' field), ~219 labs
# are already committed in history, and the files remain on disk. Commit a deliberately-kept lab with `git add -f`.
agora_output/lab/
# EXCEPT audit clones: foreign repos we measure are not ours to commit.
agora_output/audits/

# Dungeon agents mnemo working memory (runtime state)
agora-game-server/.agent_memory/

